{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o058b","title":"葬毛后愍陵","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o058b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"葬毛后愍陵","evidence":["mingdi-e-o058b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o048c-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"景初元年：毛后虽被赐死，仍加谥葬愍陵。","evidence":["houfei-e-o048c-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":237,"label":"十月癸丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y237","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o052","basis":"十月癸丑"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o058b-q","mingdi-q-o052","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o058b-q","source_order":[3,401,"O058b"],"order":928}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o048c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-fd992a8af87f0d1fe23b","layer":"original","quote":"然犹加谥，葬愍陵；迁曾散骑常侍，后徙为羽林、虎贲中郎将、原武典农〖14〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":119,"end":156},{"id":"mingdi-e-o058b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-a2135e58bed7e5b9f811","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丁未〖16〗，月犯荧惑。癸丑〖17〗，葬悼毛后于愍陵〖18〗。乙卯〖19〗，营洛阳南委粟山为圜丘〖20〗。﹝一﹞十二月，壬子冬至〖21〗，始祀〖22〗。丁巳〖23〗，分襄阳临沮、宜城、旍阳、邔四县〖24〗，﹝二﹞置襄阳南部都尉。己未〖25〗，有司奏文昭皇后立庙京都。分襄阳郡之鄀、叶县属义阳郡〖26〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
